{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26229","headline":"下第东归作 · 殷尧藩","name":"下第东归作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十载驱驰倦荷锄，三年生计鬓萧疎。\n辛勤几逐英雄後，乙榜犹然姓氏虚。\n欲射狼星把弓箭，休将萤火读诗书。\n身贱自慙贫骨相，朗啸东归学钓鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}